{"tools.wedding-checklist-generator.h1_text.wedding_planning_checklist_generator.28edbd6f":"婚礼筹备清单生成器","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.a_month_by_month_plan_built_around_your.0dcaea13":"根据你们的婚期制定逐月计划，覆盖从提前 12+ 个月到婚礼次日。可在浏览器中勾选任务——无需上传任何内容。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.home.8cf04a97":"家","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.free_tools.c746326b":"免费工具","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.h2_text.set_your_date.0a4995fe":"设定婚期","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.label_text.wedding_date.7bfce611":"婚礼日期","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.label_text.wedding_style.0dfe28fd":"婚礼风格","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.option_text.traditional_full_wedding.66f3c295":"传统式婚礼 / 完整婚礼","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.option_text.small_wedding_under_50_guests.46176068":"小型婚礼（少于 50 位宾客）","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.option_text.destination_wedding.542e6e00":"目的地婚礼","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.option_text.elopement_micro_wedding.57a40dc0":"私奔式婚礼 / 微型婚礼","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.the_knot_s_2026_real_weddings_study_puts.f0cd2ff4":"The Knot 的 2026 年《真实婚礼研究》显示，美国情侣的平均订婚筹备期为 15 个月。这份清单涵盖提前 12+ 个月的筹备事项，但无论你们实际有多少筹备时间，都能灵活调整。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.button_text.print_checklist.b12996ea":"打印清单","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.h2_text.your_planning_timeline.8c93f4bf":"你们的筹备时间表","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.0_of_0_done.c7d9bf0c":"0 / 0 已完成","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.button_text.copy_result.76cfa6f1":"复制结果","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.button_text.download_txt.5f29b5ba":"下载 .txt","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.button_text.print_pdf.963ace37":"打印 / PDF","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.button_text.another_version.647b4bc0":"另一个版本","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.button_text.reset.526d688f":"重置","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.h2_text.what_a_us_wedding_checklist_actually_cov.d7cd88b3":"美国婚礼清单实际涵盖哪些内容","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.span_text.the_two_pages_that_dominate_us_search_fo.2db01606":"在美国搜索婚礼筹备清单时占据前位的两个页面——The Knot 的 12 个月筹备倒计时和 Zola 的终极清单——采用了相同的核心框架：","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.strong_text.12_months_out_then_one_section_per_month.77451832":"从提前 12+ 个月开始，之后每月一个板块，再分为婚礼前 2 周 / 前一周 / 前一天 / 当天 / 婚礼结束后","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.span_text.both_note_that_the_average_engagement_is.e0ac2aca":"两者都指出，平均订婚筹备期约为 15 个月，因此第一阶段应侧重调研与愿景规划，而不是预订。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.our_generator_follows_that_structure_and.13fd4b9d":"我们的生成器沿用这一结构，并增加了纸质 PDF 无法实现的功能：实时进度条，以及保存在浏览器中的状态。今天勾选一项任务，三周后再回来，它仍会保持勾选状态。策划师或家长索要完整清单时，您可以直接复制或打印。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.h2_text.the_milestones_that_drive_every_other_de.7f62da8f":"影响所有后续决策的关键节点","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.th_text.when.4e97aeea":"时间","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.th_text.what_must_be_decided.64bd4110":"必须确定的事项","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.th_text.why_it_comes_first.5d1759a3":"为什么先确定这一项","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.12_months.d4bee614":"12+个月","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.budget_guest_list_draft_overall_vision_e.69bfa9c7":"预算、宾客名单初稿、整体构想、订婚派对","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.guest_count_drives_venue_size_catering_a.c48b2d3a":"宾客人数决定场地规模、餐饮安排和请柬数量","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.12_9_months.14d1a993":"12–9个月","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.venue_date_planner_photographer_videogra.1d32c505":"场地、日期、婚礼策划师、摄影师、摄像师","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.peak_season_venues_and_photographers_boo.537c0a25":"旺季场地和摄影师通常会提前12+个月预订","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.8_6_months.1d7fad5b":"8–6个月","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.catering_bar_attire_save_the_dates_hotel.9f35b355":"餐饮、酒吧、婚礼着装、预告请柬、酒店预留客房","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.destination_guests_need_8_12_months_noti.14322784":"根据美国回执指引，异地宾客需要提前8–12个月收到通知","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.3_months.de0353ca":"3个月","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.invitations_hair_makeup_trial_thank_you.4dcc3e11":"请柬、发型与妆容试妆、答谢礼","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.formal_invitations_go_out_2_3_months_bef.89910920":"正式请柬会在婚前2–3个月寄出（异地婚礼则为4–6个月）","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.2_months.e6d19733":"2个月","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.vows_alterations_favors_final_fittings.395a98a2":"婚誓、礼服修改、宾客回礼、最终试衣","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.both_the_knot_and_zola_flag_vows_here_no.d1961009":"The Knot 和 Zola 都建议在这一阶段确定婚誓——而不是婚礼前一晚","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.1_month_day_of.008ecd5f":"1个月 → 婚礼当天","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.final_headcount_seating_chart_vendor_tim.9dd8aca5":"最终人数、座位表、供应商时间表、结婚许可证","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.caterers_need_a_firm_number_7_14_days_ou.6f624274":"餐饮供应商需要提前 7–14 天确定最终人数","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.after.7bfcadb5":"之后","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.thank_you_cards_name_change_photo_album.99345e0b":"感谢卡、姓名变更、相册、评价","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.td_text.us_etiquette_targets_4_6_weeks_for_thank.1b9d78a0":"美国婚俗礼仪建议在 4–6 周内寄出感谢信","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.h2_text.where_the_words_come_in.5aef3c2b":"誓词和致辞文案准备","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.span_text.two_checklist_items_are_consistently_the.deb5fc6e":"清单中始终最难的两项任务：","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.writing_personal_vows.c1edee70":"撰写自己的婚礼誓词","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.span_text.and.be5d5d37":"和","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.drafting_the_reception_speeches.2d2fc7d6":"起草婚宴致辞","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.span_text.according_to_the_knot_s_2026_real_weddin.06eed3d7":"。根据 The Knot 的《2026 年真实婚礼研究》（涵盖 10,474 对新人），如今 61% 的情侣会自己撰写誓词——这是有记录以来的最高比例——因此，“开始准备誓词”已从可有可无的选项，变成婚礼前两个月就应完成的常规任务。这里为这两项任务分别提供了免费工具。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.h2_text.from_the_checklist_to_the_film.aa09cea9":"从清单到婚礼影片","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.span_text.nearly_every_item_on_this_list_produces.f21c988f":"这份清单中的几乎每一项都只会带来暂时性的成果：菜单、座位安排、时间表。最终长久保存下来的，只有照片和影片这两样。等你确定婚期和场地后，","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.see_how_a_cinematic_wedding_film_is_buil.8a1ce71d":"看看如何用照片打造电影感婚礼影片","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.span_text.or.e81c4e4f":"或","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.model_the_video_line_in_your_budget.99e087e1":"在预算中为视频制作费用单列一项","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.h2_text.frequently_asked_questions.af2a4d28":"常见问题","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.summary_text.how_long_before_the_wedding_should_i_sta.5557f034":"我应该提前多久开始筹备婚礼？","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.the_knot_s_2026_real_weddings_study_repo.424ff585":"The Knot 的《2026 年真实婚礼研究》显示，美国新人从订婚到婚礼的平均间隔为 15 个月。十二个月是较为宽裕的筹备期；小型婚礼或私奔式婚礼也可以在 3–6 个月内筹备完成。无论你填写哪个日期，这份清单都会随之调整，并保持任务顺序不变。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.summary_text.when_should_wedding_invitations_be_maile.d6d0ca7a":"婚礼请柬应该什么时候寄出？","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.us_etiquette_guidance_puts_formal_invita.97d0ca67":"美国婚礼礼仪指南建议，正式请柬应在婚礼前2–3个月发出，目的地婚礼则应提前4–6个月发出。本地婚礼的日期预告请柬应提前6–8个月发出，目的地婚礼则应提前10–12个月发出。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.summary_text.is_my_checklist_saved_anywhere.f9880487":"我的清单保存在哪里？","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.only_in_this_browser_s_local_storage_on.23dbec61":"只保存在此设备当前浏览器的本地存储中。不会向服务器发送任何内容，也不需要账户。清除浏览器存储会删除已保存的勾选记录——如果想保留永久副本，请先使用“打印”或“复制结果”。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.summary_text.can_i_print_the_checklist_or_share_it_wi.d033a399":"我可以打印清单或与婚礼策划师分享吗？","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.yes_print_pdf_produces_a_clean_list_with.3db2ae47":"可以。“打印 / PDF”会生成不含工具控件的整洁清单；“复制结果”会提供纯文本，你可以将其粘贴到电子邮件、共享文档或婚礼筹备电子表格中。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.summary_text.does_this_work_for_a_small_wedding_or_el.944f38db":"小型婚礼或私奔式婚礼适用吗？","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.yes_choose_small_wedding_destination_or.db44ba8c":"可以。请选择“小型婚礼”“目的地婚礼”或“私奔式婚礼”，清单会自动筛选出仍然适用的任务——你不用再为酒店房间预留配额或200人的座位安排操心。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.summary_text.when_should_we_write_our_vows.15c3248e":"我们什么时候写誓词？","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.both_the_knot_and_zola_place_the_first_v.da258ab3":"The Knot 和 Zola 都建议提前约两个月拟定第一版誓词草稿。可以先列出大致框架，再逐步润色完善；目前61%的美国夫妇会撰写个人誓词，通常建议长度控制在150–250字。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.h2_text.more_free_wedding_tools.511ec8cc":"更多免费婚礼工具","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.budget_calculator.4a2217e0":"预算计算器","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.seating_chart.0aa1b5db":"座位表","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.hashtag_generator.f0d774ee":"话题标签生成器","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.invitation_maker.eaa060de":"请柬制作工具","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.save_the_date.f3ad2c82":"婚期预告","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.photo_book_planner.a9887dd0":"照片书策划师","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.photo_collage.942e207a":"照片拼贴","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.heic_to_jpg.67ca8d18":"HEIC 转 JPG","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.alcohol_calculator.aa6ed7fc":"酒水计算器","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.vow_writer.90e3a3d2":"婚礼誓词撰写工具","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.speech_writer.7bd24d35":"致辞撰写","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.guest_count_calculator.3713f2ea":"宾客人数计算器","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.day_of_timeline.caa789f5":"婚礼当天流程表","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.h2_text.every_box_ticked_keep_the_day.c2328638":"所有事项都勾选了吗？让婚礼当天从容有序。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.the_timeline_ends_the_venue_empties_and.21a15897":"时间线结束，场馆空无一人，你再次观看这部电影。将您的照片制作成 60-90 秒的电影婚礼影片。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.a_text.get_a_free_quote.076af0bf":"免费估价 →","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.button_text.save_pdf.71ddc50b":"保存.pdf","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.label_text.wedding_date_for_calendar_export_and.40972a0a":"婚礼日期（用于日历导出和倒计时周）","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.button_text.view_by_countdown_week.72a3777b":"按倒计时周查看","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.add_your_wedding_date_to_highlight_t.536764c1":"添加您的婚礼日期以突出显示本周。","tools.wedding-checklist-generator.p_text.your_current_countdown_block_is_high.7f55403e":"您当前的倒计时块在下面突出显示。"}